        "objective": "Implement TASK-0094 acceptance criteria. 1) Add a deterministic\ncross-alignment validator in src/ahra/cross_alignment.py that\nrejects drafts where any must, must_not, or completion_signal\nboundary entry lacks a covering Claim criterionRefs reference, any\nClaim references a free_zone entry, any required Claim lacks a\ncovering PlanNode claimRef, any PlanNode claimRef does not resolve\nin the frozen ClaimGraph, or any open_question entry remains; cover\neach failure class with a unit test in\ntests/test_cross_alignment.py. 2) Wire the validator into the\nsrc/ahra/alignment_session.py exit path ahead of\nRequestDraftAdmission: on failure the RequestDraft is rejected\nbefore Human Gate 2 with a structured mismatch report recorded in\nthe session snapshot, redraft attempts are bounded, and exhausting\nthe bound terminates the session with a recorded failure; cover\nwith tests/test_alignment_session.py. 3) Keep behavior consistent\nwith the cross-alignment gate row in\ndocs/architecture/intent-alignment-workflow.md. Run\nuv run python -B scripts/check.py and record it in\nWorkReport.verification_commands_run.\n",
